{"id":"79c451e5-9236-4906-a07d-c34e322882de","name":"Predator Movie Masterpiece Action Figure 1/6 Predator (2.0) Deluxe Version 34 cm","slug":"predator-movie-masterpiece-action-figure-16-predator-20-deluxe-version-34-cm","description":"\"Those Eyes. They Just Disappeared.\" - Mac\n\nKnown for their advanced technology, stealth, and deadly skills, Predators are iconic extraterrestrial hunters that leave fans of all generations both terrified and captivated. Thriving on the thrill of the hunt, they expertly use camouflage and powerful weapons to track their prey. They first burst onto the scene in Predator (1987), where one cunningly stalks a group of elite soldiers, picking them off one by one in a heart-pounding game of survival.\n\nSideshow and Hot Toys is proud to present the new Predator Sixth Scale Figure (2.0) Collectible Figure (Deluxe Version), which perfectly captures the essence of the classic menacing alien creature.\n\nInspired by the movie Predator (1987), this screen-accurate action figure features a newly developed head sculpt with separate rolling eyeballs and multiple finely crafted rubber strands of hair. It also includes two sets of interchangeable mandibles and an LED-lighted Predator mask, offering fans multiple display options. Dressed in newly designed Predator armor with weathering effects, an overall net costume, and bone accessories, this figure recreates the iconic look of this fierce species from the movie.  The figure comes equipped with an impressive array of weapons, including an articulated shoulder cannon, blades, and a red-colored spine with a skull. \n\nThe Deluxe Version features an exciting new jungle-themed diorama base, two skull accessories, as well as an intruguing additional battle-damaged Predator mask based on a concept art design from the early development phase that never appeared in the film. This allows for an even more dynamic and captivating display. \n\nStep into the hunt with this legendary extraterrestrial hunter. 